{"translation-revision-date":"2025-08-25 15:20+0500","generator":"WP-CLI\/2.12.0","source":"src\/SocialLoginSettings.js","domain":"messages","locale_data":{"messages":{"":{"domain":"messages","lang":"fr_FR","plural-forms":"nplurals=2; plural=(n > 1);"},"Disabled":["D\u00e9sactiv\u00e9"],"Enable Social Login on":["Activer la connexion sociale sur"],"Enable Social Login on WordPress default Login and Register forms.":["Activer la connexion sociale sur les formulaires de connexion et d'inscription par d\u00e9faut de WordPress."],"Login Form":["Formulaire de connexion"],"Register Form":["Formulaire d'inscription"],"Social Login Button Label":["\u00c9tiquette du bouton de connexion sociale"],"Customize the label for social login buttons. Use <code>%provider%<\/code> to dynamically include the social provider name in the label. For example, \"Login with %provider%\" or \"Continue with %provider%\".":["Personnalisez le libell\u00e9 des boutons de connexion aux r\u00e9seaux sociaux. Utilisez <code>%provider%<\/code> pour inclure de mani\u00e8re dynamique le nom du fournisseur de r\u00e9seaux sociaux dans le libell\u00e9. Par exemple, \u00ab\u00a0Se connecter avec %provider%\u00a0\u00bb ou \u00ab\u00a0Continuer avec %provider%\u00a0\u00bb."],"Social Login Shortcode":["Code court de connexion sociale"],"Place this shortcode where you want to add social login buttons.":["Placez ce shortcode \u00e0 l'endroit o\u00f9 vous souhaitez ajouter des boutons de connexion sociale."],"Button Styles":["Styles de boutons"],"Default":["D\u00e9faut"],"Full Width":["Pleine largeur"],"Square Icons":["Ic\u00f4nes carr\u00e9es"],"Round Icons":["Ic\u00f4nes rondes"],"Button Position":["Position du bouton"],"Below":["Ci-dessous"],"Above":["Au-dessus de"],"Above with Separator":["Ci-dessus avec s\u00e9parateur"],"Facebook App ID":["Facebook App ID"],"Enter your Facebook App ID.":["Entrez votre secret Facebook App."],"Facebook App Secret Key":["Cl\u00e9 secr\u00e8te de l'application Facebook"],"Enter your Facebook App Secret Key.":["Entrez la cl\u00e9 secr\u00e8te de votre application Facebook."],"Redirect URI":["URL de redirection"],"Click to copy and paste the callback URL under \"Valid OAuth Redirect URIs\" in your Facebook API settings.":["Cliquez pour copier et coller l'URL de rappel sous \"Valid OAuth Redirect URIs\" dans les param\u00e8tres de votre API Facebook."],"Twitter API Version":["Twitter API Version"],"Select the Twitter API version to use.":["S\u00e9lectionnez la version de l'API Twitter \u00e0 utiliser."],"OAuth 1.1":["OAuth 1.1"],"OAuth 2.0":["OAuth 2.0"],"Twitter API key":["Cl\u00e9 API Twitter"],"Enter Your Consumer API key.":["Entrez votre cl\u00e9 API consommateur."],"Twitter API secret key":["Cl\u00e9 secr\u00e8te Twitter API"],"Enter Your Consumer API secret key.":["Entrez votre cl\u00e9 secr\u00e8te API consommateur."],"Twitter Callback URL":["URL de rappel Twitter"],"Enter Your Callback URL:":["Entrez votre URL de rappel :"],"Client ID":["Client ID"],"Enter Your Client ID.":["Entrez votre ID Client."],"Client Secret":["Client Secret"],"Enter Your Client Secret.":["Entrez votre secret de client."],"Enter your Redirect URI.":["Saisissez votre URI de redirection."],"Github App Name":["Nom de l'application Github"],"Enter Your Github App Name.":["Entrez le nom de votre application Github."],"Discord Generated URL":["URL g\u00e9n\u00e9r\u00e9e par Discord"],"Enter Your Discord Generated URL":["Entrez votre URL g\u00e9n\u00e9r\u00e9e par Discord"],"API Key":["Cl\u00e9 API"],"Enter Your API Key.":["Entrez votre cl\u00e9 API."],"API Secret":["Secret API"],"Enter Your API Secret.":["Entrez votre secret API."],"Callback URL":["URL de rappel"],"Enter your Callback URL":["Entrez votre URL de rappel"],"Service ID":["Num\u00e9ro de service"],"Enter Your Service ID.":["Entrez votre identifiant de service."],"Key ID":["Key ID"],"Enter Your Key ID.":["Entrez votre identifiant de cl\u00e9."],"Team ID":["ID d'\u00e9quipe"],"Enter Your Team ID":["Entrez votre identifiant d'\u00e9quipe"],"Private Key":["Cl\u00e9 priv\u00e9e"],"Enter The Private Key From the Downloaded File":["Entrez la cl\u00e9 priv\u00e9e du fichier t\u00e9l\u00e9charg\u00e9"],"Apple Secret":["Apple Secr\u00e8te"],"This JWT token is generated.":["Ce jeton JWT est g\u00e9n\u00e9r\u00e9."],"Social Login":["Connexion Sociale"],"App Configuration Successful":["Configuration de l'application r\u00e9ussie"],"You have successfully configured your app. This social provider is now set up correctly, allowing users to log in without issues.":["Vous avez configur\u00e9 votre application avec succ\u00e8s. Ce fournisseur social est d\u00e9sormais correctement configur\u00e9, ce qui permet aux utilisateurs de se connecter sans probl\u00e8me."],"Verify Settings Again":["V\u00e9rifier \u00e0 nouveau les param\u00e8tres"],"Test Your App Configuration":["Testez la configuration de votre application"],"Verify Settings":["V\u00e9rifier les param\u00e8tres"],"Settings saved successfully!":["Param\u00e8tres enregistr\u00e9s avec succ\u00e8s !"],"Looking for Another Provider?":["Vous recherchez un autre fournisseur\u00a0?"],"Need a provider not listed here?":["Besoin d'un fournisseur non r\u00e9pertori\u00e9 ici ?"],"Let us know!":["Faites-le-nous savoir\u00a0!"],"Not Verified":["Non v\u00e9rifi\u00e9"],"Enabled":["Activ\u00e9"],"Yet to Verify":["Reste \u00e0 v\u00e9rifier"],"Help Center":["Centre d'aide"],"Choose another provider":["Choisir un autre fournisseur"],"Contact Us":["Contactez-nous"],"Configure":["Configurer"],"Settings":["Param\u00e8tres"],"Saving...":["Enregistrement en cours..."],"Save Changes":["Sauvegarder les changements"],"Copy":["Copier"],"Enable":["Activer"],"Settings saved failed!":["L'enregistrement des param\u00e8tres a \u00e9chou\u00e9 !"],"Social Login add-on allows your users to log in and register using their Facebook, Google, X (Twitter) accounts and more. By integrating these social media platforms into your login system, you can eliminate spam and bot registrations effectively.":["Le module compl\u00e9mentaire Social Login permet \u00e0 vos utilisateurs de se connecter et de s'inscrire en utilisant leurs comptes Facebook, Google, X (Twitter), etc. En int\u00e9grant ces plateformes de m\u00e9dias sociaux dans votre syst\u00e8me de connexion, vous pouvez \u00e9liminer efficacement les spams et les enregistrements de robots."],"Styles":["Styles"],"Providers":["Fournisseurs"],"Login with %provider%":["Se connecter avec %provider%"],"Copied":["Copi\u00e9"],"<span id=\"facebook_redirect_uri\"><a href=\"%s?lpsl_login_id=facebook_check\">%s?lpsl_login_id=facebook_check<\/a><\/span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"loginpress-copy-btn\" data-tooltip=\"Copy\" data-copy=\"%s?lpsl_login_id=facebook_check\" data-target=\"facebook_redirect_uri\"><svg class=\"sociallogin-copy-svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 22 22\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><g clipPath=\"url(#clip0_27_294)\"><path d=\"M1.62913 0H13.79C14.6567 0 15.3617 0.7051 15.3617 1.57176V5.26077H13.9269V1.57176C13.9269 1.49624 13.8655 1.43478 13.79 1.43478H1.62913C1.55361 1.43478 1.49216 1.49624 1.49216 1.57176V13.7326C1.49216 13.8082 1.55361 13.8696 1.62913 13.8696H5.20313V15.3044H1.62913C0.762474 15.3044 0.057373 14.5993 0.057373 13.7326V1.57176C0.0574209 0.7051 0.762474 0 1.62913 0Z\" fill=\"#869AC1\"><\/path><path d=\"M8.20978 6.69557H20.3706C21.2373 6.69557 21.9424 7.40067 21.9424 8.26737V20.4282C21.9423 21.2949 21.2373 22 20.3706 22H8.20973C7.34303 22 6.63793 21.2949 6.63793 20.4283V8.26737C6.63788 7.40067 7.34308 6.69557 8.20978 6.69557ZM8.20969 20.5652H20.3706C20.4461 20.5652 20.5076 20.5038 20.5076 20.4283V8.26737C20.5076 8.19181 20.4461 8.13035 20.3706 8.13035H8.20973C8.13417 8.13035 8.07271 8.19181 8.07271 8.26737V20.4283C8.07271 20.5038 8.13417 20.5652 8.20969 20.5652Z\" fill=\"#869AC1\"><\/path><\/g><defs><clipPath id=\"clip0_27_294\"><rect width=\"22\" height=\"22\" fill=\"white\" transform=\"matrix(-1 0 0